SimulationModule["**Simulation Module**<br/>Contains Machine DelayBuffer part_generator sampling WIP and energy metrics"]
RunSimulation["**Run Simulation**<br/>Function run_simulation seed caps warmup measure_until returns throughput WIP and machine_energy"]
EvaluateIndividual["**Evaluate Individual**<br/>evaluate_single_individual runs n_replications of Run Simulation and returns avg WIP and negative throughput"]
BufferProblem["**Buffer Capacity Problem**<br/>Pymoo Problem class BufferCapacityProblem prepares X checks feasibility computes F and G"]
MultiprocPool["**Multiprocessing Pool**<br/>Spawns exactly 50 processes to evaluate feasible individuals in parallel"]
NSGA2Algorithm["**NSGA II Algorithm**<br/>Configures sampling crossover mutation population and calls Problem _evaluate"]
RunNSGA2["**Run NSGA II Optimization**<br/>Sets pop_size n_gen n_replications base_seed warmup and returns result history"]
ExportHistory["**Export History**<br/>export_history_to_csv writes feasible solutions and KPIs to results CSV file"]
DecisionVariables["**Decision Variables**<br/>Six buffer capacities for delay buffers values {1-10} integers"]
Objectives["**Objectives**<br/>Minimize WIP and minimize negative throughput to maximize throughput"]
Constraints["**Constraints**<br/>All variables must be integer and in range {1-10} infeasible individuals marked G greater than 0"]
Parameters["**Parameters**<br/>pop_size 50 n_gen 50 n_replications 3 base_seed RANDOM_SEED n_cores 50 warmup MEASURE_UNTIL"]

